00:34:04,160 --> 00:34:05,680
There has never been a stock assessment.

540
00:34:06,020 --> 00:34:08,500
It is an assumption, and I am giving it to you as one.

541
00:34:09,720 --> 00:34:11,200
But even if it is wildly wrong,

542
00:34:11,200 --> 00:34:13,680
even if it is out by an order of magnitude,

543
00:34:14,940 --> 00:34:18,940
there is an enormous quantity of a half -toned predator living in the water beneath our

544
00:34:18,940 --> 00:34:20,760
ships, and in a hundred years,

545
00:34:20,820 --> 00:34:23,060
we have watched exactly one of them swim.

546
00:34:23,720 --> 00:34:26,600
And it was a baby, and it was 30 centimeters long,

547
00:34:26,760 --> 00:34:28,080
and it found us by accident.

548
00:34:30,670 --> 00:34:31,890
Everything else we think we know,

549
00:34:32,170 --> 00:34:33,590
we got from corpses in nets,

