00:34:36,870 --> 00:34:40,350
and from careful arguments between people who have never seen the thing they are arguing

552
00:34:40,350 --> 00:34:44,360
about. It is not a monster.

553
00:34:45,080 --> 00:34:48,080
That much we can say. It is slow and cold,

554
00:34:48,560 --> 00:34:50,020
and it runs on almost nothing,

555
00:34:50,540 --> 00:34:53,680
and it has been sitting near the top of an entire ocean the whole time.

